<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié's (2007) mutual cross-inhibition + CYP26A1 RA-degradation PDE system, analytical inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) with saddle-node thresholds [M_1, M_2] = [1.0254, 3.3038] nM, and Baker, Schnell & Maini's (2006) bistable wavefront somite scaling law (L115-435), demonstrating 22.2-fold front sharpening (Delta_x_front = 16.24 um << lambda_M = 360.67 um) and exact VAD + RA symmetry S_VAD + S_RA = 300.0 um, verified by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 5 reference-anchored quantitative morphometric measurements via `measure_morphoeval()` (L520-600): saddle-node hysteresis window width Delta_M = 2.2784 nM ([M_1, M_2] = [1.0254, 3.3038] nM vs 2.2784 nM analytical reference; CYP26-null = 0.0 nM), chick PSM bistable determination front position x_front = 571.46 um vs 571.61 um (10-90% jump width = 16.24 um, 22.2x sharpening vs lambda_M = 360.67 um), VAD compressed somite length S_VAD = 105.00 um vs observed 106.0 um (opposing exogenous RA S_RA = 195.00 um vs 194.0 um; sum = 300.0 um), 5-regime Pearson correlation r = 0.9999 (p = 2.75e-7, RMSE = 0.84 um), and bilateral SEM specimen somite spacing 48.47 +/- 9.69 px (CV = 0.1999)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-measurement-chick-psm-bistable-determination-front-position-x-front-and-10-90-switch-width>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-measurement-chick-vertebrate-embryo-sem-specimen-bilateral-somite-spacing-s-obs>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-measurement-goldbeter-baker-5-regime-ra-fgf-perturbation-somite-length-pearson-correlation-r>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-measurement-ra-fgf8-wnt-saddle-node-bistable-hysteresis-window-width-delta-m-m-2-m-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-measurement-vitamin-a-deficiency-vad-anterior-wavefront-shift-compressed-somite-length-s-vad>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-morphometric-validation-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — MorphoEval overall 91.2/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 post-remediation evaluation of `2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py` (91.3/100, up from 59.6/100 in Pass 1; +31.7 overall). The remediated script derives the exact Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) with lower and upper saddle-node bifurcations M_1 = 1.0254 nM and M_2 = 3.3038 nM (hysteresis window Delta_M = 2.2784 nM vs 0.0 nM in the CYP26-null monostable control), solves the 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE system along the 1000 um chick PSM (positioning the determination front at x_front = 571.46 um with a 10-90% jump width Delta_x_front = 16.24 um, a 22.2-fold sharpening over the shallow exponential fgf8 mRNA decay length lambda_M = 360.67 um), reproduces all 5 experimental perturbation regimes (Wild-Type S_0 = 150.0 um, Vitamin A Deficiency VAD S_VAD = 105.0 um vs observed 106.0 um, Exogenous RA S_RA = 195.0 um vs observed 194.0 um satisfying S_VAD + S_RA = 300.0 um = 2*S_0, SU5402 FGFR1 block S = 215.0 um, and ectopic FGF8 bead S = 97.5 um; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.84 um), and segments the vendored chick/vertebrate SEM specimen (`chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg`, 8 upper and 9 lower somites, mean spacing 48.47 px), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean`. Overall 91.2/100 (faithfulness 91.0, reproducibility 91.7); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 88, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 93, Code-to-model traceability 91, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_comparison.png: rendered output of 2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1336827 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde (sha256 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde), spec_fingerprint 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601; artifact_sha256: 499ddc7eed5384bbf4d6f0118814a3c67b19b1d52d6608fcfe526a0864146bde; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_reference.json=42c6196ddd32cee9..., datasets/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront/scout_manifest.json=783faa9ee6b3db0c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Cell / Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 mutual cross-inhibition + CYP26A1 RA-degradation PDEs producing an S-shaped hysteresis curve [M_1, M_2] and an all-or-none determination front switch | Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) J. Theor. Biol. 239:413-429 & Diez del Corral et al. (2003) Neuron 40:65-79 opposing Vitamin A Deficiency (VAD) anterior front shift vs exogenous RA / SU5402 posterior front shift; reconstructed_in_script: Analytical inverse hysteresis S-curve M(F) solver extracting lower saddle-node M_1 = 1.0254 nM and upper saddle-node M_2 = 3.3038 nM (Delta_M = 2.2784 nM) | 1D coupled RA-FGF8/Wnt reaction-diffusion PDE solver along the 1000 um chick PSM demonstrating 22.2x sharpening of the determination front (Delta_x_front = 16.24 um vs lambda_M = 360.67 um) at x_front = 571.46 um | 5-regime somite perturbation evaluator (WT, VAD, exogenous RA, SU5402, ectopic FGF8 bead; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.84 um) plus bilateral dorsal somite row segmentation on chick_ra_fgf_somites_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing); transfer_boundary: 1D anteroposterior chick presomitic mesoderm axis mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite rows; does_not_claim: Full 3D mesenchymal-to-epithelial somite rosette mechanics or explicit intracellular Her1/Hes7 delayed transcriptional clock ODEs." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 1D Goldbeter-Pourquie RA-FGF8/Wnt bistable switch directly to a delayed Her1/Hes7 or Notch-Delta phase oscillator lattice to model saltatory somite arrest.",
        "remediation needed: Extend the 1D PSM axis to 2D bilateral paraxial mesoderm strips to model left-right asymmetric somite defects under Raldh2/VAD perturbation (Vermot & Pourquie 2005)." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.12e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquié (2007) / Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) RA–FGF8/Wnt mutual cross-inhibition bistable determination wavefront in vertebrate somitogenesis — Parameter expressivity: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates all 5 experimental regimes (wild-type control, Vitamin A Deficiency VAD v_sc = 0.08 nM/min, exogenous RA bath v_sc = 0.42 nM/min, SU5402 FGFR1 inhibition, and ectopic FGF8 bead anterior compression), compares hysteresis S-curves and PDE switch profiles across v_sc in {0.08, 0.25, 0.42} nM/min plus a CYP26-null monostable control (k_d1 = 0, n = 0) and a constitutive-FGF negative control (0 somites, Panels A-C), and exposes CLI flags (`--v-sc`, `--vg`, `--Tc`, `--seed`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
